---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="LayerTrack Privacy Policy — your farm data stays on your device. We collect nothing."
  currentPath="/privacy"
>

  <div class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p>Last updated: September 25, 2026</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">

      <h2>Overview</h2>
      <p>
        LayerTrack is a poultry farm management app designed to work entirely on your device.
        We built it with a simple principle: your farm data belongs to you.
      </p>

      <h2>Data We Do Not Collect</h2>
      <p>LayerTrack does not collect, transmit, store, or share any personal information or farm data. Specifically:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>We do not collect your name, email address, phone number, or any other personal identifier</li>
        <li>We do not collect your location</li>
        <li>We do not collect farm data such as flock records, egg production logs, feed records, sales transactions, or financial figures</li>
        <li>We do not use analytics SDKs, crash reporting services, or third-party tracking libraries</li>
        <li>We do not serve advertisements</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Data Stored on Your Device</h2>
      <p>
        All data you enter into LayerTrack — including flock records, egg production logs, feed receipts,
        consumption records, sales transactions, customer information, and financial settings — is stored
        locally on your device in a private SQLite database. This data:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Never leaves your device through the app</li>
        <li>Is not accessible to us or any third party</li>
        <li>Is removed when you uninstall the app (unless backed up by your device's system backup)</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Permissions</h2>
      <p>
        LayerTrack does not request any sensitive device permissions. The app does not access your
        camera, microphone, contacts, location, storage, or network connection.
      </p>

      <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>
        LayerTrack does not knowingly collect information from children under 13. As the app collects
        no data at all, there is no special risk to younger users.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>
        If a future version of LayerTrack introduces features that affect data collection or privacy,
        this policy will be updated and the "Last updated" date will be revised. The updated policy
        will be available in the app and on the developer's website.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>If you have questions about this privacy policy, please contact:</p>
      <p>
        <strong>Jhon Peter</strong><br />
        Email: <a href="mailto:dpunkz09@gmail.com">dpunkz09@gmail.com</a><br />
        Website: <a href="https://jpaworx.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">jpaworx.com</a>
      </p>

    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
